    color: 'purple',
    badge: 'DevSecOps',
    lead: 'SRE & Cloud Team',
    description: 'Pipelines CI/CD no GitHub Actions com Gitleaks e Semgrep, PgBouncer pool sizing e configuração de Webhook URLs.',
